style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; LETTER-SPACING: -0.9pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">외국인 동일 적용</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; LETTER-SPACING: -0.9pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; TEXT-INDENT: 7pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LETTER-SPACING: -1.4pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양중고딕\">※ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LETTER-SPACING: -1.4pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕\">단</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕; LETTER-SPACING: -1.4pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LETTER-SPACING: -1.4pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕\">해당 대기자가 없을 경우 임의선발</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; TEXT-INDENT: 7pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LETTER-SPACING: -1.4pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LETTER-SPACING: -2.2pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">라</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; LETTER-SPACING: -2.2pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LETTER-SPACING: -2.2pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">신평관은 광시스템공학과</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; LETTER-SPACING: -2.2pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LETTER-SPACING: -2.2pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">메디컬</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; LETTER-SPACING: -2.2pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\">IT</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LETTER-SPACING: -2.2pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">융합공학과 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; LETTER-SPACING: -2.2pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\">3·4</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LETTER-SPACING: -2.2pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">학년을 우선선발하나 대기자가 없을 경우 임의선발</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; TEXT-INDENT: 7pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; TEXT-INDENT: 7pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LETTER-SPACING: -2.2pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\">5. 유의사항</span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><table style=\"BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; mso-table-overlap: never\"><tbody><tr><td valign=\"middle\" style=\"BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.7pt solid; HEIGHT: 97.35pt; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.7pt solid; WIDTH: 462.1pt; BACKGROUND: #e9ae2b; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.7pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.7pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt\"><p class=\"0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">중도 퇴사자가 발생할 경우에만 선발하며</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-asci